            "text": "{\n  \"variants\": [\n    {\n      \"concept\": \"Compare one kit with separate items\",\n      \"primary_text\": \"Choosing childproofing pieces one by one can mean keeping track of several items. The Peach Bucket’s 6-in-1 child safety kit brings together edge and corner protectors, socket guards, cabinet and fridge locks, and door guards for Indian homes. Listed at ₹3,299, with ₹299 prepaid savings. 1-to-1 installation video support is available. Adult supervision remains necessary.\",\n      \"headline\": \"Explore The Peach Bucket 6-in-1 Kit\",\n      \"cta\": \"Shop Now\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"concept\": \"Show the kit’s components and offer\",\n      \"primary_text\": \"Comparing individual childproofing products? The Peach Bucket 6-in-1 kit includes edge and corner protectors, socket guards, cabinet and fridge locks, and door guards. It’s listed at ₹3,299, with ₹299 prepaid savings. 1-to-1 installation video support is available if you’d like guidance. Adult supervision remains necessary.\",\n      \"headline\": \"Childproofing Pieces, Together in One Kit\",\n      \"cta\": \"Shop Now\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"concept\": \"Share support and stated guarantees\",\n      \"primary_text\": \"If you’re deciding whether to shop for childproofing pieces individually or consider a kit, The Peach Bucket offers a 6-in-1 child safety kit for Indian homes: edge and corner protectors, socket guards, cabinet and fridge locks, and door guards. It’s listed at ₹3,299, with 1-to-1 installation video support, a 30-day money-back guarantee, and a 720-day eligible-failure replacement guarantee. Adult supervision remains necessary.\",\n      \"headline\": \"Consider a Child Safety Kit for Your Home\",\n      \"cta\": \"Shop Now\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"internal_notes\": \"Copy uses the supplied product and offer details without adding policy terms, compatibility, completeness, installation-speed, scarcity, or safety guarantees. Audience motivations are treated as